    <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Which rate applies to me — buy or sell?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Rates are always quoted from the kantor's side — WE BUY or WE SELL the currency. We buy = you bring us currency. At a buy rate of EUR 4.40, for 100 euro you receive 440 zł. We sell = you buy currency from us. At a sell rate of GBP 5.10, for 100 British pounds you pay 510 zł."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What is your spread?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "A few groszy. At retail the difference between our buy and sell rate is at most 0.09 PLN (9 groszy). At wholesale it is 0.01–0.03 PLN*: that is the rate we show for 5 000 EUR, and you can negotiate from the equivalent of as little as 500 EUR. Both tables, retail and wholesale, are always on our board and on this page. (*during Polish FX market hours)"}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What is the difference between złoty (zł) and PLN?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "None — it is the same currency. PLN is the international code of the Polish złoty (like EUR for the euro), and zł is the everyday abbreviation you will see on price tags. 10 zł = 10 PLN."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Which currencies do you exchange?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "🇪🇺 EUR (euro), 🇺🇸 USD (US dollars), 🇬🇧 GBP (British pounds), 🇨🇭 CHF (Swiss francs), 🇨🇦 CAD (Canadian dollars), 🇦🇺 AUD (Australian dollars), 🇩🇰 DKK (Danish krone), 🇸🇪 SEK (Swedish krona), 🇳🇴 NOK (Norwegian krone), 🇨🇿 CZK (Czech koruna), 🇭🇺 HUF (Hungarian forints), 🇯🇵 JPY (Japanese yen), 🇦🇪 AED (UAE dirhams)— plus euro coins and withdrawn or damaged banknotes, after contacting us first. You can send photos on WhatsApp: wa.me/48889505057"}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Are the rates negotiable?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. For larger amounts the rate is agreed individually at the counter. The wholesale rate can be negotiated from the equivalent of as little as 500 EUR; it depends on the amount, so just ask. The wholesale table on this page shows rates for 5 000 EUR (spread 0.01–0.03 PLN*). (*during Polish FX market hours)"}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I pay by card?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We exchange cash only — like every traditional kantor in Poland."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you buy old, withdrawn or damaged banknotes?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes — withdrawn series, damaged banknotes and euro coins. Call us first at +48 889 505 057 or send photos on WhatsApp: wa.me/48889505057"}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do I need an ID to exchange money?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "For everyday amounts — no. Polish anti-money-laundering law requires identification only for transactions from the equivalent of 15,000 EUR."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Are you open on weekends?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Saturday: 10:00–20:30; Sunday: closed; Monday–Friday: 09:30–20:30"}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is Floriańska a safe street to exchange money?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Honestly? The street's reputation is mixed — some offices in the area display only one attractive rate, which applies to the opposite direction of the exchange. Others display no rates at all, and some show rates for other currencies, such as ALL, RSD or JOD, labelled with € $ £ symbols to mislead you. That is exactly why we play with open cards: the full buy and sell table on display, 0% commission, and you can verify any exchange office — including ours — in 30 seconds via fresh Google Maps reviews. Honest exchange on Floriańska exists; just check the board and the reviews, and ask for the rate at the counter before you hand over cash."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is this the former \"Kantor U Górali\"?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes — the same exchange office at Floriańska 37 and the same owner. We changed the name so it says out loud who we are: the black sheep among Kraków's exchange offices — the one that plays with open cards. Full buy and sell rates on display, 0% commission, no asterisks. The name changed; the rules didn't."}}]}</script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">

    <style is:inline>

        :root {
            --ink: #0a0a0a;
            --panel: #141414;
            --paper: #f5f5f4;
            --mist: #a3a3a3;
            --dim: #6b6b6b;
        }

        * { -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
            *, *::before, *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
        }

        body { font-family: 'Montserrat', 'Montserrat Fallback', sans-serif; background: var(--ink); color: #fff; }

        /* Brand lockup: KANTOR extrabold/white, BLACK SHEEP bold/gray */
        .brand-top { font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #fff; }
        .brand-sub { font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.09em; color: var(--mist); }

        /* Stacked lockup (like the arch sign): KANTOR large, BLACK SHEEP
           letterspaced beneath so both lines run to roughly the same width.
           Scale the whole lockup with font-size on .lockup itself. */
        .lockup { display: inline-block; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .lockup .top {
            display: block; font-weight: 800; color: #fff;
            font-size: 1.9em; letter-spacing: 0.068em;
        }
        .lockup .sub {
            display: block; font-weight: 700; color: var(--mist);
            font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-top: 0.22em;
        }
        .lockup .sub b { color:#fff; font-weight:800; }

        .facts p { margin: .5rem 0; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #d4d4d4; }
        .facts b { color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }

        .display { font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
        .eyebrow { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.28em; color: var(--mist); }
        .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

        .board-digit { font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255,255,255,0.35); }

        .diamonds {
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 25%, transparent 25%),
                linear-gradient(225deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 25%, transparent 25%),
                linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 25%, transparent 25%),
                linear-gradient(315deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 25%, transparent 25%);
            background-size: 44px 44px;
        }

        .stars { position: relative; display: inline-block; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        .stars .base { color: #3f3f3f; }
        .stars .fill { position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; color: #fff; width: var(--rating, 90%); }

        .btn-solid {
            background: #fff; color: var(--ink); border-radius: 9999px;
            font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 0.85rem;
            padding: 1rem 2rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.6rem;
            transition: transform 0.15s ease, opacity 0.15s ease;
        }
        .btn-solid:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); opacity: 0.92; }
        .btn-ghost {
            border: 1px solid #fff; color: #fff; border-radius: 9999px;
            font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 0.85rem;
            padding: 1rem 2rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.6rem;
            transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
        }
        .btn-ghost:hover { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); }

        .lang-btn { padding: 0.35rem 0.7rem; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dim); border-radius: 9999px; }
        .lang-btn.active { color: var(--ink); background: #fff; }

        /* Rate tiers: retail + wholesale, both always on the board */
        .tier-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.75rem; padding: 1.1rem 1.5rem 0.2rem; }
        .tier-head-2 { border-top: 1px solid #262626; margin-top: 0.25rem; }
        .tier-name { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); border-radius: 9999px; padding: 0.3rem 0.95rem; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; }
        .tier-sub { font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--mist); text-align: right; }
        /* Sekcja lokalizacji. Telefon: zdjęcie, adres z przyciskiem, mapka, godziny, kontakt. Komputer: zdjęcie obok mapki, karty pod spodem. */
        .loc-wrap { max-width: 60rem; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; grid-template-areas: "photo" "addr" "map" "hours" "contact"; }
        .loc-photo { grid-area: photo; min-width: 0; }
        .loc-wrap .loc-cards { display: contents; }
        .loc-cards > :nth-child(1) { grid-area: addr; }
        .loc-cards > :nth-child(2) { grid-area: hours; }
        .loc-cards > :nth-child(3) { grid-area: contact; }
        #area-map { grid-area: map; width: 100%; max-width: 440px; margin: 0 auto; }
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .loc-wrap { grid-template-areas: "photo" "map" "cards"; }
            .loc-wrap .loc-cards { display: grid; grid-area: cards; min-width: 0; }
            .loc-cards > :nth-child(n) { grid-area: auto; }
        }
        @media (min-width: 900px) {
            .loc-wrap { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-areas: "photo map" "cards cards"; align-items: start; column-gap: 1.5rem; }
            #area-map { max-width: none; }
        }
        .spread-line { padding: 0.35rem 1.5rem 0.2rem; font-size: clamp(0.66rem, 3.05vw, 0.8rem); font-weight: 600; color: #d4d4d4; white-space: nowrap; }
        .stale-note { margin: 0 1.5rem 1rem; padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem; border: 1px solid #525252; border-radius: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.78rem; color: #e5e5e5; }

        /* Retail / wholesale segmented control */
        .seg {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4px;
            background: #262626; border: 1px solid #3a3a3a;
            border-radius: 9999px; padding: 4px; width: 100%;
        }
        .seg button {
            border-radius: 9999px; padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            color: #fff; transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
        }
        .seg button:hover { background: #333; }
        .seg button.active { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); }
        .seg button.active:hover { background: #fff; }

        .chip {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; border-radius: 9999px;
            border: 1px solid #2e2e2e; color: #d4d4d4;
            padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        }

        input:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible, a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #fff; outline-offset: 2px; }
        #calculator input:focus, #calculator select:focus, #calculator button:focus-visible { outline-color: #0a0a0a; }
        input[type=number]::-webkit-inner-spin-button, input[type=number]::-webkit-outer-spin-button { -webkit-appearance: none; margin: 0; }
        input[type=number] { -moz-appearance: textfield; }

        /* very narrow phones: keep the nav on one line */
        @media (max-width: 400px) {
            .lockup { font-size: 0.55rem !important; }
            .lang-btn { padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 430px) {
            thead th { letter-spacing: 0.14em; }
        }

        /* FAQ accordion */
        .faq { border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 1rem; background: #fff; }
        .faq + .faq { margin-top: 0.75rem; }
        .faq summary {
            list-style: none; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 1rem; padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
        .faq summary::after { content: "+"; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #737373; transition: transform 0.15s ease; }
        .faq[open] summary::after { transform: rotate(45deg); }
        .faq p { padding: 0 1.25rem 1.1rem; font-size: 0.92rem; color: #404040; line-height: 1.55; }
        .faq .curr { display: block; padding: 0.18rem 0; font-weight: 600; color: #262626; }
        .faq a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; font-weight: 700; color: #0a0a0a; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- ================= NAV ================= -->
    <nav class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 bg-black/90 backdrop-blur border-b border-neutral-800 px-4 sm:px-6">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between h-16">
                <a href="#top" class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <Logo variant="lockup" base="" />
                </a>

                <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8">
                    <a href="#rates" class="eyebrow hover:text-white transition-colors" data-i18n="nav_rates">Rates</a>
                    <a href="#calculator" class="eyebrow hover:text-white transition-colors" data-i18n="nav_calc">Calculator</a>
                    <a href="#visit" class="eyebrow hover:text-white transition-colors" data-i18n="nav_visit">Find us</a>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1 border border-neutral-700 rounded-full p-0.5">
                        <button class="lang-btn active" id="btn-en" onclick="setLanguage('en')">EN</button>
                        <button class="lang-btn" id="btn-pl" onclick="setLanguage('pl')">PL</button>
                    </div>
                    <span class="hidden sm:inline-flex"><a href="tel:+48889505057" class="btn-ghost !py-2 !px-4 !text-xs num !gap-2">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
                        </svg>+48 889 505 057</a></span>
                    <a href="tel:+48889505057" aria-label="Call +48 889 505 057" class="sm:hidden inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white text-white">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
    <header id="top" class="diamonds relative overflow-hidden pt-20 pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6">
        <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-start">

            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow mb-3"><span class="whitespace-nowrap" data-i18n="hero_eyebrow_1">Currency exchange</span> · <span class="whitespace-nowrap" data-i18n="hero_eyebrow_2">Kraków Old Town</span></p>
                <h1 class="display text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl leading-[1.08] mb-2 lg:mb-3" data-i18n="hero_title">Don't get fleeced.</h1>
                <img src="images/hero-flock.webp" width="1408" height="768" fetchpriority="high" alt="Sheared white sheep and one untouched black sheep — don't get fleeced" class="w-full -mt-12 mb-6 lg:-mt-14 lg:mb-3 lg:max-w-lg pointer-events-none select-none">
                <p class="text-neutral-400 text-base sm:text-lg mb-4 max-w-md" data-i18n="hero_slogan">The best exchange rates in Kraków's Old Town, with a spread of just a few groszy. The rate you see is the rate you get.</p>

                <a href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=3299726714959505459" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group inline-flex items-center mb-6" aria-label="4.8 out of 5 stars on Google Maps">
                    <span class="stars text-lg" style="--rating: 96%;" aria-hidden="true">
                        <span class="base">★★★★★</span>
                        <span class="fill">★★★★★</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm ml-2">4.8</span>
                    <span class="text-sm text-neutral-400 underline underline-offset-4 group-hover:text-white transition-colors ml-3" data-i18n="hero_reviews">on Google Maps</span>
                </a>

                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                    <a href="#rates" class="btn-solid" data-i18n="btn_rates">See today's rates</a>
                    <a href="#visit" class="btn-ghost" data-i18n="btn_visit">How to find us</a>
                </div>

            </div>

            <!-- ============ THE BOARD (kaseton) ============ -->
            <div id="rates" class="scroll-mt-24 relative z-10">
                <div class="bg-[--panel] border border-neutral-800 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-black/60">
                    <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-neutral-800">
                        <span class="brand-top text-sm"><span class="whitespace-nowrap" data-i18n="board_title">Currency Exchange Rates</span> <span class="brand-sub whitespace-nowrap">· Black Sheep</span></span>
